WEBVTT

00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:32.209
If you're one of those people,
estimates suggest that over your career,

00:02:32.233 --> 00:02:36.476
it can cost you
an average of 750,000 dollars.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.143
Grace can relate to this.

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:40.434
GS: I would dread negotiating.

00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:42.851
I was 100 percent a pushover.

00:02:42.875 --> 00:02:44.434
AG: I know the feeling.

00:02:44.458 --> 00:02:45.726
Back when I was 18,

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.684
I was hired to sell ads
for the "Let's Go" travel books.

00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:50.851
I was supposed to call up
last year's clients

00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.809
and convince them to renew their ads.

00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:54.434
I was terrified.

00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:55.976
How was I supposed to negotiate

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.726
with marketing execs
more than twice my age?

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:02.184
Our renewal rate was 95 percent,
but by the end of the first week,